; Two diagnostics in document order:
;   1. wrong_underlying on (phrase :name 42) — the validator's
;      regular form-keys check rejects the number-typed name.
;   2. not_cross_ref on `p0` — the index pass skipped the malformed
;      phrase, so its name never registered.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code wrong_underlying :path [phrase name])
  (diagnostic :code not_cross_ref    :path [track sequence]))
